sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as User / CLI (workspace.add)
    participant Daemon as autodoc --serve
    participant Watcher as fsnotify Watcher (core/follow)
    participant Scanner as Tree Walker & Parser
    participant Store as SQLite WAL Store (core/store)
    participant Embed as Embedding Worker Pool

    CLI->>Daemon: workspace.add {name, root, include, exclude}
    Daemon->>Watcher: 1. Attach recursive fsnotify watches BEFORE scan
    Watcher-->>Daemon: Watch descriptors active (buffering events)
    Daemon->>Scanner: 2. Walk directory tree (honoring exclude globs)
    loop Every matching .md file
        Scanner->>Scanner: Compute SHA-256, parse YAML frontmatter & headings
        Scanner->>Scanner: Split into section chunks (target section_tokens)
    end
    Scanner->>Store: 3. Commit lexical chunks, FTS5 tokens & wikilinks (batch tx)
    Daemon->>Watcher: 4. Drain buffered watch events (coalesce by path + mtime/hash)
    Watcher->>Store: Apply any concurrent edits that occurred during scan
    Daemon-->>CLI: Workspace ready for lexical & graph queries
    Daemon->>Embed: 5. Enqueue changed chunk hashes (if embedding_policy != off)
    Embed->>Store: Stream vector embeddings asynchronously in background
